<div class="wp-block-group alignwide has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="background-color:#11111100"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill" style="grid-template-columns:33% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-1024x819.png);background-position:50% 50%"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="819" src="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-1024x819.png" alt="" class="wp-image-416 size-full" srcset="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-1024x819.png 1024w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-300x240.png 300w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-768x614.png 768w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-1536x1229.png 1536w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Dark-Blue-Modern-Technology-Twitter-Header-2500-×-2000-px-2048x1638.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="headlineo9miankco">Affordable Hosting Prices</h4>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-small-font-size">Affordable ASIC-Miner-Hosting directly from the experts offers you many advantages and enables you to mine without technical know-how. We at Miner Control were able to negotiate a favorable framework agreement for our customers with our partners. </p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group alignwide has-white-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="background-color:#11104d"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group alignwide has-white-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="background-color:#11104d"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group alignwide has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="background-color:#11104d"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-columns has-background is-layout-flex wp-container-3 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex" style="background-color:#11104d">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="headlinexcligg7q4"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-white-color">We offer comprehensive services for your project</mark></h4>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-small-font-size"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-white-color">Our data center is not only in the immediate vicinity of a power supply, it is directly connected to a hydroelectric power plant. Of course, we do not operate the hydroelectric power plant ourselves, but the location offers a great advantage. According to Ohm&#8217;s law, the distance to the energy source also plays a major role, so if the power from the power plant is &#8222;scarce&#8220;, the electricity flows first to our data center, because geographically we are simply right next to the power plant and the associated substation.</mark></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" src="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hosting-infograph-facility.png" alt="" class="wp-image-45" width="314" height="362" srcset="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hosting-infograph-facility.png 800w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hosting-infograph-facility-259x300.png 259w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hosting-infograph-facility-768x888.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 314px) 100vw, 314px" /></figure>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile has-white-color has-text-color has-background" style="background-color:#11104d;grid-template-columns:24% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="887" height="1024" src="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer-887x1024.png" alt="" class="wp-image-200 size-full" srcset="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer-887x1024.png 887w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer-260x300.png 260w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer-768x887.png 768w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer-1330x1536.png 1330w, https://miner-control.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/asic-miner-millionminer.png 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="headlineqxnm74muf">Your ASICSs are important to us that&#8217;s why we take care of them</h4>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-small-font-size">We worked for a long time on a suitable cooling concept and finally decided to simply copy the cooling concept of many ASIC miners in superlative. What does this mean? Our cold air system ensures that every 2 seconds the entire air in the data center is completely exchanged, so that the best possible cooling performance is achieved without the use of environmentally harmful gases.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



