				   <aside id="text-1" class="widget widget_text"><h4 class="widget-title">About Miner Control</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><div class="textwidget">
				<p>Cryptocurrencies are currently the best-known blockchain based application and open up completely new possibilities.

We as PPK Technology Group help our customers with our services to understand this new technology and the associated opportunities and to make them usable for themselves. MINER CONTROL, as part of PPK Technology Group, operates 3 mining sites in Belgium, Norway and Canada and focuses on renewable energy and strives for the highest possible efficiency.</p>
				<div class="footer-badge">
					<img src="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/plugins/clever-fox/inc/gradiant/images/footer/about-01.png" alt="">
					<img src="https://miner-control.com/wp-content/plugins/clever-fox/inc/gradiant/images/footer/about-02.png" alt="">
					
				</div>
			</div></div>
